  "about": {
    "title": "About the Pokémon GO set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Pokémon GO is a Sword & Shield expansion released on 1 July 2022. It has 88 cards: 78 in the main set and 10 secret rares. There are also 57 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 78 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (135 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 145 cards, adding the 10 secret rares).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
